## DotnetExtension

**Namespace:** `Cyrena.Dotnet`
**Assembly:** `Cyrena.Dotnet`

### Purpose
Entry point for the `cyrena.dotnet` extension. Registers .NET project type builders, project type detectors, and shortcuts.

### Class Definition

```csharp
public class DotnetExtension : Extension
{
    public override void BuildExtension(CyrenaBuilder builder)
    {
        builder.AddDotnetDevelopment();
    }
}
```

### Extension Manifest

```json
{
  "id": "cyrena.dotnet",
  "name": ".NET Development",
  "version": "0.4.0",
  "entryAssemblyFile": "Cyrena.Dotnet.dll",
  "description": "Develop .NET projects or solutions.",
  "dependencies": [
    { "id": "cyrena.developer", "minVersion": "0.4.0" },
    { "id": "cyrena.api_references", "minVersion": "0.4.0" }
  ],
  "requireFrameworkBuilder": true
}
```

### Registration
```csharp
public static CyrenaBuilder AddDotnetDevelopment(this CyrenaBuilder builder)
{
    // ICodeBuilder implementations
    builder.Services.AddSingleton<ICodeBuilder, SolutionBuilder>();
    builder.Services.AddSingleton<ICodeBuilder, BlazorAppSolutionBuilder>();
    builder.Services.AddSingleton<ICodeBuilder, ClassLibrarySolutionBuilder>();
    builder.Services.AddSingleton<ICodeBuilder, MvcAppSolutionBuilder>();
    builder.Services.AddSingleton<ICodeBuilder, BlazorLibrarySolutionsBuilder>();

    // IDotnetProjectType implementations
    builder.Services.AddSingleton<IDotnetProjectType, CSharpClassLibraryProjectType>();
    builder.Services.AddSingleton<IDotnetProjectType, BlazorLibraryProjectType>();
    builder.Services.AddSingleton<IDotnetProjectType, BlazorAppProjectType>();
    builder.Services.AddSingleton<IDotnetProjectType, MvcProjectType>();
    builder.Services.AddSingleton<IDotnetProjectType, MvcLibraryProjectType>();

    // Shortcuts
    builder.AddShortcut<DotnetShortcut>();
    builder.AddShortcut<BlazorAppShortcut>();
    builder.AddShortcut<ClassLibraryShortcut>();
    builder.AddShortcut<MvcAppShortcut>();
    builder.AddShortcut<MvcLibraryShortcut>();
    builder.AddShortcut<BlazorLibraryShortcut>();
    return builder;
}
```

### Notes
- `BlazorLibrarySolutionsBuilder` (plural) is the correct type name for the Blazor Library builder registration.
- `BlazorAppShortcut` (not `BlazorAppShortuct`) is the correct shortcut type name.
- All shortcut types are internal `IShortcut` implementations in `Cyrena.Dotnet.Models` namespace.
